{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>That</b> — for thus it is written to Abraham concerning his seed: \"and I will be Elohim to them.\" And on account of these good things that HaShem did with these your fathers — you are the children."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {0 "The verse cited is Genesis 17:8, ending with והייתי להם לאלהים, though Ibn Ezra quotes only its final phrase."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:35.925140531Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}